The texts of the laws in this repository are not copyright works under Thai law: section 7 of the Copyright Act
B.E. 2537 (1994) (พระราชบัญญัติลิขสิทธิ์ พ.ศ. ๒๕๓๗ มาตรา ๗) excludes the Constitution and laws, and regulations,
rules, announcements, orders and other official texts of the state, from copyright.

Source of the text: the Office of the Council of State (สำนักงานคณะกรรมการกฤษฎีกา), law database
https://searchlaw.ocs.go.th/council-of-state/ . The OCS publishes no terms of use for the database. Its consolidated
texts are an aid, not the official text: the official text is the one published in the Royal Gazette
(ราชกิจจานุเบกษา).

The arrangement of the repository, the commit messages, the tables, the documentation and the scripts in tools/ are
by Lexifina. The repository is private; reuse terms for them have not been set.
